  intro_id: "Al-Mundhiri's abridgment of Sahih Muslim, authenticated by al-Albani: the authentic narrations arranged by chapters of jurisprudence. Presented here in 2,179 hadith with Arabic, English and Urdu."
  intro_roman-ur: "Al-Mundhiri's abridgment of Sahih Muslim, authenticated by al-Albani: the authentic narrations arranged by chapters of jurisprudence. Presented here in 2,179 hadith with Arabic, English and Urdu."
  intro_ru: "Al-Mundhiri's abridgment of Sahih Muslim, authenticated by al-Albani: the authentic narrations arranged by chapters of jurisprudence. Presented here in 2,179 hadith with Arabic, English and Urdu."
  intro_ta: "Al-Mundhiri's abridgment of Sahih Muslim, authenticated by al-Albani: the authentic narrations arranged by chapters of jurisprudence. Presented here in 2,179 hadith with Arabic, English and Urdu."
